<title>ALGERIA: INDICATORS - ALGERIA - UPDATED DECEMBER 30.</title>
<headline>INDICATORS - ALGERIA - UPDATED DECEMBER 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>Trade figures 1996 - Jan-Sept (U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>			   Jan-Sept 96  Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p> Exports		 8.9 bln	7.02  bln</p>
<p> Imports		 6.67 bln     8.2 bln</p>
<p> Deficit/Surplus    +2.23 bln    -1.13 bln</p>
<p> Oil/gas exports     8.49 bln     6.76 bln</p>
<p>(The Algerian government reported a $2.23 billion trade</p>
<p>surplus for the period Jan-Sept 1996)</p>
<p>Source: Government official data.</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Indicators 1996 - monthly	 Month     Pvs mth    Yr ago</p>
<p> CPI (pct change)	  May     +4.3	 +2.5	 N/A</p>
<p> CPI annualised	    May     22.1	 21.6	 N/A</p>
<p> Ind output 1995 (pct change)     N/A	  N/A</p>
<p>(Source: National Office of Statistics)</p>
<p>  Inflation rate	  forecast 97     end 1996   end 1995</p>
<p>				under 10 pct    16.5 pct   29 pct</p>
<p>(Source: prime minister, Dec 96)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Hard currency reserves (bln U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>			   end 1996	   end 1995</p>
<p>			     4.0 bln	   2.0 bln</p>
