<p>  -  Interest rates	   Latest    Date	Pvs 13-week</p>
<p>  13-week T-bill		21.25     1/6/96    21.75 (May)</p>
<p>  26-weeek T-bill	     21.50     1/6/96    22 pct (April)</p>
<p>Source: Algerian treasury.</p>
<p>Note: Algeria plans to start issuing one-year, two-year and</p>
<p>five-year notes in the future.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
